  "description": "Provider-neutral payment abstractions: contracts for customers and saved payment methods, payee accounts and their onboarding, charges and transfers, and webhook verification, with minor-unit arithmetic and the shared resilient HttpClient registration the NuvTools.Payment provider clients build on. Reference this from an application layer and let a provider package, such as NuvTools.Payment.Stripe.ApiClient, be registered in the composition root.",
